    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us7000srfx](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us7000srfx) Magnitude 5.5 earthquake at 81.095 depth occurred on Jun 08 2026 23km NW of Sarangani. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 5.532 longitude 125.2525. It impacted 149832 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
